{"id":"ffee1dd616b0911b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-axiom-check.md","title":"Axiom Check Predicate","display":"df-axiom-check — Axiom Check Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-axiom-check","aliases":["92-df-axiom-check"],"display":"df-axiom-check — Axiom Check Predicate","depends_on":["[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-formal-system]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 35–36（PDF 52–53）","source_status":"本地公理码成员定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-axiom-check"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-axiom-check</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-axiom-check — Axiom Check Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 35–36（PDF 52–53）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地公理码成员定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (Gödel number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> (formal system over the coded signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}\\)</span> (formal-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> (axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Axiom}_{\\mathcal F}\">\\(\\mathrm{Axiom}_{\\mathcal F}\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}check} \\vdash \\mathrm{Axiom}_{\\mathcal F}(n) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)\\;\\bigl(n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}check} \\vdash \\mathrm{Axiom}_{\\mathcal F}(n) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)\\;\\bigl(n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>公理检验谓词：判断编号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>是否是公理的Gödel编号</li>\n<li>当公理码集合在本书的有效编码下是原始递归集时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Axiom}_{\\mathcal F}\">\\(\\mathrm{Axiom}_{\\mathcal F}\\)</span> 才是原始递归谓词</li>\n<li>包括逻辑公理和非逻辑公理</li>\n<li>命题公理、量词公理、等式公理</li>\n<li>PA特有公理：后继、加法、乘法、归纳</li>\n<li>公理检验是证明验证的基本步骤</li>\n<li>算术化中的关键组件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书将 A(x) 拆成十九个模式的算术公式。本文 Axiom_F 是通用码成员关系，任意系统的公理集并不自动有效；原书的明确模式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a9f2cffd9da7a09c\" href=\"?note=a9f2cffd9da7a09c\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms\">92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fc67eebb6ab0c5ba\" href=\"?note=fc67eebb6ab0c5ba\" title=\"92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic\">92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"634d28e30ada0b29\" href=\"?note=634d28e30ada0b29\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-induction\">92-df-smullyan-induction</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)$ with $\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)$ (formal system over the coded signature, see [[92-df-formal-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FormalSys}$ (formal-system predicate, see [[92-df-formal-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)$ (axiom set, see [[92-df-axiom-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"a9f2cffd9da7a09c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书将 A(x) 拆成十九个模式的算术公式。本文 Axiom_F 是通用码成员关系，任意系统的公理集并不自动有效；原书的明确模式见 [[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]] 和 [[92-df-smullyan-induction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"fc67eebb6ab0c5ba","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书将 A(x) 拆成十九个模式的算术公式。本文 Axiom_F 是通用码成员关系，任意系统的公理集并不自动有效；原书的明确模式见 [[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]] 和 [[92-df-smullyan-induction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-induction","status":"resolved","id":"634d28e30ada0b29","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书将 A(x) 拆成十九个模式的算术公式。本文 Axiom_F 是通用码成员关系，任意系统的公理集并不自动有效；原书的明确模式见 [[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]] 和 [[92-df-smullyan-induction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FormalSys}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Axiom}_{\\mathcal F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}check} \\vdash \\mathrm{Axiom}_{\\mathcal F}(n) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)\\;\\bigl(n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Axiom}_{\\mathcal F}","display":false}],"bytes":1869,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-check]]"}],"outgoing":["35c764f4e9f21f28","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","6a1ff87567369c3c","a9f2cffd9da7a09c","fc67eebb6ab0c5ba","634d28e30ada0b29"]}